{"unit_id":"deepseekv41flash__dsh-compaction-cache#card-zh","repo":"deepseekv41flash/dsh-compaction-cache","commit":"05a3c2cb924ac74ca12f533269b00fdac9a9308a","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-compaction-cache 是一个 DeepSeek Harness 插件，用于改善会话压缩时的模型前缀缓存复用。它接入 llm/stream 请求流水线，仅处理 purpose 标记为 compaction 的摘要请求，并从会话路由头补齐 reasoningEffort、temperature 等未设置参数，同时可将 maxTokens 对齐到路由值。插件提供开关、镜像参数列表和日志选项，异常时继续原请求流程。适合使用摘要压缩且希望复用路由请求缓存参数的 DSH 用户；需要安装到 profile 并提供 sessions 服务，不要求额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:200-250","lib/index.js:100-123"]}
{"unit_id":"deepseekv41flash__dsh-compaction-cache#card-en","repo":"deepseekv41flash/dsh-compaction-cache","commit":"05a3c2cb924ac74ca12f533269b00fdac9a9308a","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-compaction-cache aligns compaction summaries with session route parameters in DeepSeek Harness. It hooks llm/stream, fills unset reasoningEffort and temperature, and can align maxTokens for tagged compaction calls. Requests continue if session data is unavailable. No extra API key is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:200-250","lib/index.js:100-123"]}
