{"unit_id":"deepseekv41flash__dsh-compaction-cache#feature-1","repo":"deepseekv41flash/dsh-compaction-cache","commit":"05a3c2cb924ac74ca12f533269b00fdac9a9308a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-compaction-cache 的功能「镜像路由参数」：压缩摘要请求缺少配置时，从会话请求头补入推理档位和温度等参数。它在 llm/stream 中自动触发，只处理标记为 compaction 的请求。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:100-115","lib/index.js:214-230"]}
{"unit_id":"deepseekv41flash__dsh-compaction-cache#feature-2","repo":"deepseekv41flash/dsh-compaction-cache","commit":"05a3c2cb924ac74ca12f533269b00fdac9a9308a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-compaction-cache 的功能「对齐输出令牌上限」：将摘要请求的 maxTokens 改为路由配置中的正整数值。该功能默认开启，也可通过 alignMaxTokens 关闭。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:116-123","lib/index.js:177-185"]}
{"unit_id":"deepseekv41flash__dsh-compaction-cache#feature-3","repo":"deepseekv41flash/dsh-compaction-cache","commit":"05a3c2cb924ac74ca12f533269b00fdac9a9308a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-compaction-cache 的功能「异常时继续请求」：读取服务或调整参数遇到异常时捕获错误，并继续调用 waterfall 的 next，让当前模型请求按后续流程处理。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:214-250"]}
{"unit_id":"deepseekv41flash__dsh-compaction-cache#feature-4","repo":"deepseekv41flash/dsh-compaction-cache","commit":"05a3c2cb924ac74ca12f533269b00fdac9a9308a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-compaction-cache 的功能「配置与状态日志」：可关闭对齐日志，插件挂载时会记录启用状态；缺少路由头时只提示一次，便于了解压缩参数是否已调整。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:200-212","lib/index.js:214-243"]}
